#: ../../source/peripherals/uart.md:10
msgid ""
"The UART driver provides an interface for configuring and using "
"asynchronous serial ports. It supports communication parameter "
"configuration (baud rate, parity, stop bits), pin multiplexing (Pinmux), "
"data transmission (blocking mode), and data reception (blocking and non-"
"blocking interrupt modes). It also supports hardware flow control "
"(RTS/CTS)."
msgstr ""
"UART 驱动提供了配置和使用异步串口的接口。它支持通信参数配置（波特率、校验位、停止位），引脚复用（Pinmux），数据发送（阻塞模式）和数据接收（阻塞和非阻塞中断模式）。它还支持硬件流控制（RTS/CTS）。"

