#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`TLK_UART_USED_DMA`**   Indicates that at least one UART instance needs"
" a DMA functionality. This option is automatically selected when "
"`UART{i}_USED_DMA` is enabled for any UART instance."
msgstr ""
"**`TLK_UART_USED_DMA`**   表示至少一个 UART 实例需要 DMA 功能。当任何 UART 实例启用了 `UART{i}_USED_DMA` 时，此选项会自动被选中。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/uart.md:282
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`TLK_UART_USED_PM_DEVICE`**   Indicates that UART power management "
"support is enabled in the system. This option is automatically selected "
"when `UART{i}_PM_DEVICE` is enabled for any UART instance."
msgstr ""
"**`TLK_UART_USED_PM_DEVICE`**   表示系统中启用了 UART 电源管理支持。当任何 UART 实例启用了 `UART{i}_PM_DEVICE` 时，此选项会自动被选中。"

#: ../../source/peripherals/uart.md:285
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`TLK_UART_USED_FLOW_CONTROL`**   Indicates that hardware flow control "
"(RTS/CTS) is enabled in the system. This option is automatically selected"
" when `UART{i}_FLOW_CONTROL` is enabled for any UART instance."
msgstr ""
"**`TLK_UART_USED_FLOW_CONTROL`**   表示系统中启用了硬件流控制（RTS/CTS）。当任何 UART 实例启用了 `UART{i}_FLOW_CONTROL` 时，此选项会自动被选中。"

